    "result_text": "**BUILD SUCCESS** \u2014 all 262 tests pass, 0 failures, 0 errors.\n\n## Summary\n\nI unified `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`, and removed the standalone `checkDigit` field.\n\n**API contract (`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`)** \u2014 the `OwnerDto` is generated from this spec. Replaced the `customerCode`, `checkDigit`, and `membershipNumber` schema properties with a single `memberId` property, and updated the `locality`/`fiscalYear` descriptions to reference the memberId's segments.\n\n**Domain model (`Owner.java`)** \u2014 renamed the stored `customer_code` column/field to `member_id` with matching getter/setter. Renamed the column in all four DB schemas (`h2`, `hsqldb`, `mysql`, `postgres`).\n\n**Controller (`OwnerRestControllerV1.java`)** \u2014 replaced `nextCustomerCode`/`deduplicateCustomerCode` with `nextMemberId`/`deduplicateMemberId`:\n- `memberId = REGION + FY(2-digit fiscal year of the business-day-adjusted registrationDate) + HASH8(first-8 upper-hex of SHA-256 over normalizedTelephone+lastName) + CHK(Luhn over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>`)`.\n- Collision handling now de-duplicates the memberId (appending `-<n>`).\n- The audit log line and the `OwnerCreatedEvent` now carry the memberId.\n\n**Mapper (`OwnerMapper.java`)** \u2014 removed `formatCheckDigit` and `formatMembershipNumber`; `memberId` now maps straight through. `formatFiscalYear` and `formatLocality` now derive the FY and REGION segments *from the memberId* (fixed-length trailing FY/HASH8/CHK), so fiscal-year and owner-segment values reference the memberId. Kept `fiscalYearStart` (still used by membership-points).\n\n**Audit event (`OwnerCreatedEvent.java`)** \u2014 the primary identifier is now published under the `memberId` JSON key.\n\nThe new `AcceptanceTest.coreReturnsUnifiedMemberId` passes (memberId starts with `NSW`, contains the computed HASH8, and the old fields are gone), and all pre-existing tests remain green.",
